models.description:
Multiple product images per product with ordering and main image designation.

This table stores all images associated with a product. Each product can have multiple images that are ordered by sort_order. The is_main flag indicates which image serves as the thumbnail. Sellers can upload, reorder, and delete images during product management. All image changes are preserved in product snapshots created during product edits.

